jobRequirements:
•	Background in International Relations, Political Science, Public Policy or related disciplines preferred; candidates with a Science or Engineering background are welcome to apply;
•	Relevant working experience in international relations, partnerships, diplomacy or a related field;
•	Strong analytical abilities with a broad sense of perspective, and the ability to synthesise complex information into clear, actionable insights;
•	Excellent communication and interpersonal skills with the ability to work effectively with internal teams, government agencies and senior stakeholders;
•	A collaborative team player who is self-motivated and comfortable managing multiple priorities across different workstreams;
