jobResponsibilities:
1.	Developing an understanding of seniors preferences and care needs for ageing in place.
2.	Developing new housing models for seniors which are twinned with care services, to allow seniors to age within the community. This will involve the full spectrum of policy development, including policy formulation, service planning, project evaluation, and implementation; 
