The broad areas of responsibilities for the portfolio include the following:

• Engage and collaborate with the identified Sectoral Leads (MCCY, MSF, MOH, SSG, MTI, NRF and A*STAR) and Domain Leads (IRAS, CAD and GovTech) to develop/review and implement initiatives, frameworks and practices to improve grants management within each sector, as well as to build up capabilities;
